	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチク『……うむ！▼
プラズマだんに　よって
せけんは　そうぞうしくなった▼
じぶんの　ポケモンと　むきあう……
それすら　なやむようになった▼
もちろん　どうつきあうか
かんがえるのは　よいことだが▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:48:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチク『……うむ！▼
プラズマ団に　よって
世間は　騒々しくなった▼
自分の　ポケモンと　向き合う……
それすら　悩むように　なった▼
もちろん　どうつきあうか
考えるのは　よいことだが▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:49:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:14:26" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『じぶんで　こたえを　みつけよ▼
そういわれても
なかなか　むずかしいことだからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:49:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『自分で　答えを　みつけよ▼
そういわれても
なかなか　難しいことだからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:49:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T08:59:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:15:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチク『……でだ▼
わたしが　でる　えいがで
ポケモンとの　つながりを　みてもらい▽
みなに　あんしん　してもらえれば▼
……そう　かんがえたのだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:17:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:16:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチク『……でだ▼
わたしが　でる　映画で
ポケモンとの　つながりを　みてもらい▽
みなに　安心してもらえれば▼
……そう　考えたのだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:49:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:16:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_bigfour3_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンブ『おお！　なるほどな▼
ジムに　こもっていて
やってくる　ちょうせんしゃと▽
かたらうだけでは　つたわらんもんな！▼
だが　だいじょうぶ　なのか？
さつえいちゅうに　ケガを……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:18:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:17:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンブ『おお！　なるほどな▼
ジムに　こもっていて
やってくる　挑戦者と▽
語らうだけでは　伝わらんもんな！▼
だが　大丈夫なのか？
撮影中に　ケガを……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:50:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_BIGFOUR3
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:17:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『……レンブよ
ハチクは　きめておるのだ▼
しんぱいは　ときとして
ひとの　かのうせいを　つぶすぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:50:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:18:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『……レンブよ
ハチクは　決めておるのだ▼
心配は　時として
人の　可能性を　つぶすぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:50:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:18:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチク『だいじょうぶ　です
まよいは　ありませんから▼
それに　レンブどのの
こころづかいも　うれしいもの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:51:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:22:32" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチク『大丈夫です
迷いは　ありませんから▼
それに　レンブ殿の
心遣いも　うれしいもの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:51:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:22:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……わかかったのだ▼
どんな　アクションも　こなせる！▼
そう　かしんし
ひつようのない　きけんに　いどんだ▼
それこそが
じぶんの　そんざいかち　だと▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:51:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:23:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……わかかったのだ▼
どんな　アクションも　こなせる！▼
そう　過信し
必要のない　危険に　いどんだ▼
それこそが
自分の　存在価値だと▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:51:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:22:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そう……　えんじることで
なにかを　つたえることよりも▽
アクションの　すごさだけを　もとめた▼
それゆえの　ケガなのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:24:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:24:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そう……　演じることで
なにかを　伝えることよりも▽
アクションの　すごさだけを　求めた▼
それゆえの　ケガなのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:51:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:24:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_bigfour3_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンブ『わかる　きがする▼
つよさ　だけを　もとめると
なぜ　もとめるのかが　うすれ▼
しょうり　という　けっかだけを
ほっして　しまうものな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:28:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:27:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンブ『わかる　気がする▼
強さ　だけを　求めると
なぜ　求めるのかが　薄れ▼
勝利　という　結果だけを
欲して　しまうものな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:51:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_BIGFOUR3
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:27:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『それでだ
わたしも　きめたことがある！▼
わたしも　チャンピオンを　やめる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:52:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:28:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『それでだ
わたしも　決めたことがある！▼
わたしも　チャンピオンを　辞する！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T13:02:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:28:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>われわれこそ
ポケモンと　ともに　いきる　いみを▽
みつめなおさねば　ならん▼
だが　せぞくは
まだ　ふあんで　ゆらいでおる▼
そこで　あたらしい　きぼうを
みなに　みせたくてな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:53:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:30:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>われわれこそ
ポケモンと　共に生きる　意味▽
みつめなおさねば　ならん▼
だが　世俗は
まだ　不安で　揺らいでおる▼
そこで　新しい　希望を
みなに　みせたくてな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:53:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・反対方向を向いて
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_bigfour3_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンブ『まあ　そりゃ
ししょうが　きめたことなら▼
それに　はんたいしても
きかないんでしょ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:31:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:30:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンブ『まあ　そりゃ
師匠が　決めたことなら▼
それに　反対しても
きかないんでしょ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:53:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_BIGFOUR3
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:30:46" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『でしいり　してきたときと
うってかわって　ものわかりが　よいな▼
あれか？▼
してんのうに　なると
それなりに　おとなに　なるのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:32:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:32:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『弟子入り　してきたときと
うってかわって　物分りが　よいな▼
あれか？▼
四天王に　なると
それなりに　大人に　なるのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:54:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:32:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_bigfour3_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レンブ『じぶんが　つよければ
ポケモンも　つよくなる……▼
それは　かならずしも
せいかいではないと　ポケモンが▽
おしえてくれたから　ですかね？▼
では　スパーリングの
あいてを　させていただきますよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:54:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:34:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レンブ『自分が　強ければ
ポケモンも　強くなる……▼
それは　必ずしも
正解ではないと　ポケモンが▽
教えてくれたから　ですかね？▼
では　スパーリングの
相手を　させていただきますよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:54:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_BIGFOUR3
レンブ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:34:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_leader7_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチク『では　じぶんが
みとどけましょう……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:37:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:37:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチク『では　自分が
見届けましょう……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:55:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_LEADER7
ハチク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:37:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_oldc01r0501_old_champion_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『たすかる▼
あたらしく　チャンピオンと　なる
トレーナーの　かべと　なるべく▼
さいこうの　じょうたいで
ポケモンしょうぶを　したいからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:55:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:38:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『助かる▼
新しく　チャンピオンと　なる
トレーナーの　壁と　なるべく▼
最高の　状態で
ポケモン勝負を　したいからな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:55:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:29:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・レンブアデクが向き合う
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-04T09:39:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLD_CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
